      "updated_at": "2016-11-02T12:30:18Z",
      "body": "Well, the description for this repo says \"OpenID Connect (OIDC) and OAuth2 protocol support for browser-based JavaScript applications\" :)\n\nBut sure, if I knew what that was more, then I'd love to hear what support is needed. Is isomorphic a native framework for running JS & react?\n",
