      "created_at": "2016-11-11T20:51:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-11T20:52:14Z",
      "body": "The reason this is desirable is because it means that a React application can benefit from all the speed of a cached application on initial pageload, but subsequent interactions/routes/etc can be handled within the browser. In addition to performance benefits, it also has SEO benefits.\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
