      "created_at": "2016-11-11T20:57:08Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-11T20:57:08Z",
      "body": "At any rate, it seems that you would want to give the user the option to use no browser-based storage of any kind, even if they aren't writing isomorphic applications. Concerns of personally identifiable information being what they, it seems you would want to give the user the option of passing in a simple in-memory object as a store.\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
